keywords:
  - design systems
  - typography
  - fonts
  - OpenType
  - variable fonts
  - licences
  - Google Fonts
  - Serbian
abstract: >-
  Font families used by public design systems, and open-licence font families (Google Fonts and original
  foundry repositories, Inter included). For each family: licence, provider, source, variable-font status,
  OpenType figure and ligature features, Serbian character coverage and file hashes. Metadata only; no font files.
